{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:48:04+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sealand Survivor", "steam_appid": 3270660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEALAND SURVIVOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How do you escape an island in the middle of the ocean?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up stranded on a mysterious island with no way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a strange <strong>hole</strong> buried somewhere on the island. An old <strong>radio</strong> keeps sending cryptic signals. And scattered across the island are objects, puzzles, and strange events that seem completely unrelated...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until you realize they aren't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is connected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the clues you discover to unlock new paths, solve strange mysteries, and uncover what really happened on the island. Every mini-game is more than just a challenge — it can contain a clue that helps you solve the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you connect all the pieces, uncover the island's secret, and find a way back home?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE SPIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/9b6817369712a6cbf90e001bafddada4.poster.avif?t=1788296964\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/9b6817369712a6cbf90e001bafddada4.webm?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/9b6817369712a6cbf90e001bafddada4.mp4?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spinning top. A simple game that everyone knows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But can you stop it <strong>exactly on the 167th spin</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It sounds easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It isn't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUT THE RIGHT WIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/252bfc26c778b91a64f881796603e2e3.poster.avif?t=1788296964\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/252bfc26c778b91a64f881796603e2e3.webm?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/252bfc26c778b91a64f881796603e2e3.mp4?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bomb is counting down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight wires.<br>Only one is correct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose carefully. You don't have time to test them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Which one will you cut?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIECE TOGETHER THE MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/1ae339dd8f1d73923a074846bf0c4a39.poster.avif?t=1788296964\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/1ae339dd8f1d73923a074846bf0c4a39.webm?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/1ae339dd8f1d73923a074846bf0c4a39.mp4?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find a broken photograph floating in the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the pieces back together and take a closer look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The picture isn't just a picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's a clue.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CATCH THEM ALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/5a649e09130bfe5f7f5ed91e9187b6cc.poster.avif?t=1788296964\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/5a649e09130bfe5f7f5ed91e9187b6cc.webm?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/5a649e09130bfe5f7f5ed91e9187b6cc.mp4?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fish you need are right in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch them one by one and get them into the bucket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a catch...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have to catch every fish in one go.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a fish and the bucket tips over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the fish escape back into the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you have to start all over again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE THE ISLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/480815b0bcb6d9edc537a5334476abf9.poster.avif?t=1788296964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/480815b0bcb6d9edc537a5334476abf9.mp4?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mini-games.<br>Follow the clues.<br>Investigate the anomalies.<br>Listen to the radio.<br>Explore the mysterious hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together everything you've discovered and uncover the truth behind the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When every anomaly has been solved, there is only one thing left to do:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after everything you've seen...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you sure you want to leave?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEALAND SURVIVOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How do you escape an island in the middle of the ocean?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up stranded on a mysterious island with no way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a strange <strong>hole</strong> buried somewhere on the island. An old <strong>radio</strong> keeps sending cryptic signals. And scattered across the island are objects, puzzles, and strange events that seem completely unrelated...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until you realize they aren't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is connected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the clues you discover to unlock new paths, solve strange mysteries, and uncover what really happened on the island. Every mini-game is more than just a challenge — it can contain a clue that helps you solve the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you connect all the pieces, uncover the island's secret, and find a way back home?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE SPIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/9b6817369712a6cbf90e001bafddada4.poster.avif?t=1788296964\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270660/extras/9b6817369712a6cbf90e001bafddada4.webm?t=1788296964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"http